// MintMaker/Renovate overrides for this repository. MintMaker merges these on
// top of its global config, which sets the managers, the release-age delay,
// vulnerability alerts, branch naming and PR limits:
// https://github.com/konflux-ci/mintmaker/blob/main/config/renovate/renovate.json
// A key set here replaces the inherited value; packageRules are added to the
// inherited ones. MintMaker docs: https://konflux-ci.dev/docs/mintmaker/user/
//
// Scope: only auto-merge the two update families that were sitting on manual
// review for hours-to-a-day with no real review value, per
// https://github.com/openshift-online/rosa-agent/issues/91 - each one is
// already validated by the PR's own Konflux build pipeline before merge, so
// a human approval adds latency without adding signal:
//   - dockerfile digest/patch/minor: UBI base-image rebuilds (e.g. #69-style
//     bumps). These are also the actual mechanism that ships CVE fixes for
//     base-image-inherited packages - see #91 - so merging them promptly is
//     the fix, not a per-package dnf forward-pin PR racing the same rebuild.
//   - tekton: Konflux pipeline/task-bundle digest bumps in .tekton/ (the
//     #62/#90 mechanism). A bad bundle digest fails the PR's own build, so
//     it's safe to auto-merge once that passes.
// Everything else (gomod, github-actions, majors) stays on manual review -
// not in scope for this change.
{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "packageRules": [
    {
      "description": "UBI base-image rebuilds: digest/patch/minor only, majors stay manual",
      "matchManagers": ["dockerfile"],
      "matchUpdateTypes": ["digest", "patch", "minor"],
      "automerge": true
    },
    {
      "description": "Konflux pipeline/task-bundle digest bumps in .tekton/ - validated by the PR's own build",
      "matchManagers": ["tekton"],
      "automerge": true
    }
  ]
}
